I'm gonna think about t, and x, and y.

04:14.685 --> 04:18.442
So t, and x, and y.

04:18.442 --> 04:21.859
So when t is equal to negative one third,

04:22.816 --> 04:25.242
well our x is going to
be, this is going to be

04:25.242 --> 04:28.773
sine of zero, so our
