04:36.310 --> 04:38.785
So, we're talking about,
we're talking about

04:38.785 --> 04:42.768
the point zero comma negative two over 27.

04:42.768 --> 04:45.971
So that is that point right over there.

04:45.971 --> 04:47.918
That's the point where
we're trying to find

04:47.918 --> 04:49.145
